{"id": "fh-0191", "domain": "photo sharing app screens", "names": ["Login", "Feed", "Post", "Profile", "Settings", "Logout"], "text": "I'm sketching the main screens of a photo sharing app and I need the navigation to make sense. Login leads to Feed. Feed should connect to Post and Profile. Put Settings at the top right, that's where people expect it. Logout should be near Settings. Make Login green since it's the start. Make Post huge, it's the main action. Connect Profile to Settings, and Settings to Logout. Is there a path from Login to Logout? Which shape is the most connected? Hmm, describe the whole thing for the readme. Undo the last change if the layout looks weird. Thanks, the team will review it Monday.", "wires": [{"span": "Login leads to Feed", "trigger": "leads to", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Login", "to": "Feed"}}, {"span": "Feed should connect to Post and Profile", "trigger": "should connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Feed", "to": "Post,Profile"}}, {"span": "Put Settings at the top right", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Settings", "position": "topRight"}}, {"span": "Logout should be near Settings", "trigger": "should be near", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Logout", "position": "near", "anchor": "Settings"}}, {"span": "Make Login green", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Login", "color": "green"}}, {"span": "Make Post huge", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Post", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "Connect Profile to Settings, and Settings to Logout", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Profile,Settings,Logout", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Is there a path from Login to Logout", "trigger": "Is there a path", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Login", "to": "Logout"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the most connected", "trigger": "most connected", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "describe the whole thing for the readme", "trigger": "describe", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe"}}, {"span": "Undo the last change", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0192", "domain": "volcano science fair", "names": ["Magma", "Crust", "Vent", "Ash", "Lava"], "text": "Hi! My group is building a diagram for the volcano science fair. Magma rises into the Vent. Connect Vent to Lava, and Lava to Ash. Ash falls onto the Crust. Make Magma red. Hmm, Lava should be the bright one, so make Lava yellow instead. Is the Vent bigger than the Crust? Move the Crust below the Magma. Add a small gray circle named Smoke above the Vent. Which shape has the most connections? Duplicate Ash two times. Thanks, our judge is a geologist.", "wires": [{"span": "Magma rises into the Vent", "trigger": "rises into", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Magma", "to": "Vent"}}, {"span": "Connect Vent to Lava, and Lava to Ash", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Vent,Lava,Ash", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Ash falls onto the Crust", "trigger": "falls onto", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ash", "to": "Crust"}}, {"span": "Make Magma red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Magma", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "make Lava yellow instead", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lava", "color": "yellow"}}, {"span": "Is the Vent bigger than the Crust", "trigger": "bigger than", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Vent", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Crust"}}, {"span": "Move the Crust below the Magma", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Crust", "position": "below", "anchor": "Magma"}}, {"span": "Add a small gray circle named Smoke above the Vent", "trigger": "Add", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "gray", "name": "Smoke", "position": "above", "anchor": "Vent"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the most connections", "trigger": "most connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Ash two times", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Ash", "count": "2"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0193", "domain": "mall parking lot", "names": ["Entry", "Exit", "Row1", "Row2", "Row3", "Booth"], "text": "I'm sketching the parking lot for the mall, the planners want a clear picture. Entry is at the bottom, the cars come in from the road. Arrange Row1, Row2 and Row3 in a column. Put Booth between Entry and Row1. Connect Entry to Booth and Booth to Row1. Exit goes to the top right corner. Make Booth yellow so it is easy to see. Is Row2 below Row1? Move Row3 below Row2 if it is not. Which shape has the least connections? Rename Booth to Ticket. Also, is there a path from Entry to Row3? Duplicate Row1 once for the second row of spaces. How many shapes do we have now? Thanks, the planners meet Thursday.", "wires": [{"span": "Entry is at the bottom", "trigger": "is at", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Entry", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Arrange Row1, Row2 and Row3 in a column", "trigger": "Arrange", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Row1,Row2,Row3", "layout": "column"}}, {"span": "Put Booth between Entry and Row1", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Booth", "position": "between", "anchor": "Entry,Row1"}}, {"span": "Connect Entry to Booth and Booth to Row1", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Entry,Booth,Row1", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Exit goes to the top right corner", "trigger": "goes to", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Exit", "position": "topRight"}}, {"span": "Make Booth yellow", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Booth", "color": "yellow"}}, {"span": "Is Row2 below Row1", "trigger": "Is Row2 below", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Row2", "position": "below", "anchor": "Row1"}}, {"span": "Move Row3 below Row2 if it is not", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Row3", "position": "below", "anchor": "Row2"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the least connections", "trigger": "least connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leastConnected"}}, {"span": "Rename Booth to Ticket", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Booth", "name": "Ticket"}}, {"span": "is there a path from Entry to Row3", "trigger": "is there a path", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Entry", "to": "Row3"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Row1 once", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Row1"}}, {"span": "How many shapes do we have now", "trigger": "How many shapes", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0194", "domain": "startup pitch deck flow", "names": ["Problem", "Solution", "Market", "Team", "Ask"], "text": "Working on the story flow for our pitch deck, slides are boxes. Problem comes first, then Solution, then Market. Connect those three in a chain. Team goes after Market, and Ask is the last slide. Connect Market to Team and Team to Ask. Make Ask gold because it is the money slide. Is Team left of Ask? Shrink Problem a bit, it's too heavy. Which shape has the most connections? Move Team to the right of Market. Rename Ask to Funding. Thanks, I'll show it to my cofounder tonight.", "wires": [{"span": "Connect those three in a chain", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Problem,Solution,Market", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Connect Market to Team and Team to Ask", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Market,Team,Ask", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Make Ask gold", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ask", "color": "gold"}}, {"span": "Is Team left of Ask", "trigger": "left of", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Team", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Ask"}}, {"span": "Shrink Problem a bit", "trigger": "Shrink", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Problem"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the most connections", "trigger": "most connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "Move Team to the right of Market", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Team", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Market"}}, {"span": "Rename Ask to Funding", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Ask", "name": "Funding"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0195", "domain": "science fair poster", "names": ["Plant", "Water", "Sun", "Chart", "Table"], "text": "My daughter has a science fair on Friday and we're making her poster diagram on this canvas. Plant is in the middle, Water and Sun are on either side. Move Water to the left of Plant. Move Sun to the right of Plant. Connect Water to Plant and Sun to Plant, with arrows. Make Plant green, it is the thing we are growing. Chart should be near Table. Is Chart bigger than Plant? Hmm, make Chart a bit bigger, resize it. What's the leftmost shape? Put the Table at the bottom center. Undo the last move if the sun went to the wrong side. Thanks, you are very patient with us.", "wires": [{"span": "Plant is in the middle", "trigger": "is in the middle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Plant", "position": "center"}}, {"span": "Move Water to the left of Plant", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Water", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Plant"}}, {"span": "Move Sun to the right of Plant", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sun", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Plant"}}, {"span": "Connect Water to Plant and Sun to Plant", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Water,Sun", "to": "Plant"}}, {"span": "Make Plant green", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Plant", "color": "green"}}, {"span": "Chart should be near Table", "trigger": "should be near", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Chart", "position": "near", "anchor": "Table"}}, {"span": "Is Chart bigger than Plant", "trigger": "bigger than", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Chart", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Plant"}}, {"span": "resize it", "trigger": "resize", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Chart"}}, {"span": "What's the leftmost shape", "trigger": "leftmost", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}, {"span": "Put the Table at the bottom center", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Table", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Undo the last move", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0196", "domain": "tabletop fantasy map", "names": ["Village", "Forest", "Mountain", "Cave", "Castle", "River"], "text": "Our tabletop campaign map needs a cleanup before session. The Castle is on the top of Mountain? Put Castle above Mountain. Connect Village to Forest and Forest to Cave. Connect Mountain to Village with a dotted link, that is the river route. Make Cave black. Is there a path from Village to Castle? Which shape is closest to Village? Duplicate Forest three times for new forests. Rename River to Stream. Show me all the black shapes. Thanks, the players will love it.", "wires": [{"span": "Put Castle above Mountain", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Castle", "position": "above", "anchor": "Mountain"}}, {"span": "Connect Village to Forest and Forest to Cave", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Village,Forest,Cave", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Connect Mountain to Village with a dotted link", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Mountain", "to": "Village", "style": "dotted"}}, {"span": "Make Cave black", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cave", "color": "black"}}, {"span": "Is there a path from Village to Castle", "trigger": "Is there a path", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Village", "to": "Castle"}}, {"span": "Which shape is closest to Village", "trigger": "closest to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Village", "superlative": "closest"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Forest three times", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Forest", "count": "3"}}, {"span": "Rename River to Stream", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "River", "name": "Stream"}}, {"span": "Show me all the black shapes", "trigger": "Show me all", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "black"}}]}
